---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { SEASONAL_RATES } from '../lib/pricing';
import { formatTHB } from '../lib/booking';
const periods = ['May–September', 'April & October', 'March & November', 'December–February'];
---
<Layout title="Seasonal rates & longer stays" description="Understand The Title V’s seasonal accommodation estimates, from ฿1,000 per night. Weekly stays save 10%; stays of 28 nights or more save 20%.">
  <section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">MORE TIME. MORE ROOM TO UNWIND.</p><h1>A stay that fits<br /><em>your rhythm.</em></h1><p class="lede">A short escape or a month to call Rawai home. Our calculator brings the nightly rates and longer-stay discounts together in one clear estimate.</p></section>
  <section class="container content-section two-columns"><div class="rich-copy"><h2>The seasons of your stay</h2><p>These are our proposed accommodation reference rates for each one-bedroom apartment, informed by historical stays. Your exact estimate depends on the dates you choose.</p><table class="rate-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">SEASON</th><th scope="col">MONTHS</th><th scope="col">THB / NIGHT</th></tr></thead><tbody>{SEASONAL_RATES.map((rate, index) => <tr><td>{rate.name}</td><td>{periods[index]}</td><td>{formatTHB(rate.nightlyRate)}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table><h2>Stay longer, <em>save a little.</em></h2><h3>7–27 nights · 10% off</h3><p>A week gives you time to slow down and discover a few favourite places. We deduct 10% from the accommodation subtotal automatically.</p><h3>28 nights or more · 20% off</h3><p>Unpack properly. Find your morning routine. For stays of at least 28 nights, the calculator applies a 20% discount instead of the weekly discount.</p><h3>A simple example</h3><p>Seven nights entirely in green season: ฿1,000 × 7 = ฿7,000. A 10% weekly discount takes the accommodation estimate to <strong>฿6,300</strong>. A 28-night stay in the same season comes to <strong>฿22,400</strong> after the monthly discount.</p><h2>What happens across seasons?</h2><p>Every night uses the rate for its own date. For a stay from October into November, October nights use the shoulder-season rate and November nights use the high-season rate. The length-of-stay discount is then applied to the combined subtotal. Check-out day is not charged as a night.</p><h2>Bringing everyone?</h2><p>For the two adjacent apartments, nightly prices are added together and the same length-of-stay discount applies. Both apartment calendars must be open for the entire stay.</p><div class="notice">This is an accommodation estimate, not a confirmed all-in offer. Ask your host to confirm utilities, cleaning, deposits, payment and cancellation terms before making payment.</div></div><aside class="aside-note"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S DO THE MATHS</p><h3>Your dates.<br /><em>Your estimate.</em></h3><p>See the nightly breakdown, longer-stay discount and accommodation total in one place.</p><a class="button" href="/book/">Calculate your stay <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a><a class="text-link" href="/booking-terms/" style="margin-top:18px">Read the booking details <Icon name="arrow" size={14}/></a></aside></section>
</Layout>
